Package: norSTR
Title: Allele Frequencies for 50 Forensic STR Markers
Version: 0.2.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Magnus Dehli", "Vigeland", , "m.d.vigeland@medisin.uio.no", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9134-4962"))
Description: Allele frequency databases for 50 forensic short tandem
    repeat (STR) markers, covering Norway and several broader regional
    populations: Europe, Africa, South America, West Asia, Middle Asia,
    and East Asia. Developed and maintained for use at the Department of
    Forensic Sciences, Oslo, Norway.
